# Go
/bin/
/dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
# Root-level built cmd binaries (`go build` / `make build` outputs; make build puts them in ./bin).
# A glob so every cmd/* binary — synapse-ast, synapse-callgraph, … — is ignored and none is ever
# committed again (the macOS synapse-ast binary previously was). No tracked repo file matches this.
/synapse-*

# Env / secrets (never commit)
.env
.env.local
*.local

# Node / web
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.kiro/
*.swp

# Local data / evidence
/data/
*.db

# local scratch prompt file
prompt.txt

# Docs site (mkdocs build output)
/site/

# goreleaser build output
dist/
